\section{Scope, provenance, and leakage boundary}
This program follows the frozen protocol at
\texttt{\VAR{summary.protocol|latex}}. It asks whether a custom neural family
can use multiscale \cn{} history and operational weather more reliably than
simple and generic controls. Cycle 0 established useful tree-model weather
signal while Horizon v1 failed to exploit it reliably. Fusion v2 therefore
tests interaction throughout its representation rather than a suppressible
final weather gate.

